    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever dreamt of visiting Greece, Iceland, or Spain? Well, guess what? You can experience these amazing places without paying a fortune. You don’t even have to worry about "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "visas",
            "zh": "签证"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or plane tickets. Some theme parks in China have recreated these famous "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "destinations",
            "ref": "v-destination"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Attractions",
            "ref": "v-attraction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like Little Santorini, Little Iceland, and Little Spain are quite popular with young people. They are super clean, safe, and comfortable. There’s just one problem—they’re not real. To visit the real places, you have to be tough because the real Santorini is a really steep climb in the heat. And the real cold of Iceland will blow you away!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Right now, I’m exploring Andalusia in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rural Spain",
            "zh": "西班牙乡村"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Everything here is a bit strange and surprising. There are no straight lines or flat surfaces. I feel like I’m on another planet. The heavy walls lean into the narrow streets, and you have to walk fast in case they fall. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Rusty",
            "zh": "生锈的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " balconies hang from every apartment. And watch out for those "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cobblestone",
            "zh": "鹅卵石"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " streets—they’ll "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trip you up",
            "zh": "把……绊倒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " if you’re not careful. The houses are coloured to match the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "surrounding",
            "ref": "v-surrounding"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cliffs",
            "zh": "悬崖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sure, if it’s just pictures that you are after, you can just visit these fake tourist attractions. Real travel is harder, but you will feel like a movie star. Travelling to new places is like stepping into a movie. And if you come to rural Spain, you will certainly be the centre of attention. Travelling here is also like going back in time. When I look out over a nearby square from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "patio",
            "zh": "露台"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of a coffee shop, I can see the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "breastplates",
            "zh": "胸铠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "helmets",
            "zh": "头盔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "conquistadors",
            "zh": "西班牙征服者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shining in the sun. I think it’s impossible to have these same feelings and thoughts while visiting Little Spain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The natural environment, history, language, architecture, traditional dress, and music all work together to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fire up",
            "ref": "v-fire-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my imagination. They are what make a place real. The perfectly constructed fake places will give you an idea of what the real places are like, just like photos do. But we all know that "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "pictures can’t tell the whole story"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", don’t we?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
